  "solution": {
    "text": "Concentrated aqueous sodium hydroxide can separate a mixture of  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>  and  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>  forms white gelatinous precipitate of  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> , which is soluble in excess of NaOH.<br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>  forms reddish brown precipitate of  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> , which is insoluble in excess of NaOH."
